DESCRIPTION:One Book. A Lifetime of Clients. — Free Online Masterclass T
 hursday\, July 30\, 2026\, 10:00–11:00 a.m. Pacific\, live on Zoom. Free
 . Sonoma County book marketing strategist Judy M. Baker leads a 60-minute 
 working session for nonfiction authors who want their published book to ke
 ep working long after launch. In one hour\, you'll see how your book becom
 es a client-attraction asset — not a one-time product — and leave with
  a practical plan to reach more readers. The session includes a hands-on e
 xercise and live Q&A. Best suited to nonfiction authors\, coaches\, and co
 nsultants. Presented by Judy M. Baker\, founder of Buzzworthy Books and cr
 eator of the BEES Method. Register free: https://onebookmasterclass.buzzwo
 rthybooks.com/ Contact: judyb@buzzworthybooks.com
LOCATION:Buzzworthy Books
URL:https://onebookmasterclass.buzzworthybooks.com/
