DESCRIPTION:Dive into the world of sourdough baking in this hands-on class
 ! Learn how to create and feed a sourdough starter\, master the basics of 
 bulk fermentation\, and shape different types of loaves. Along the way\, y
 ou’ll gain an understanding of timing\, technique\, and the simple ingre
 dients that make sourdough bread so special.\n\nPerfect for beginners read
 y to explore artisan breadmaking\, this workshop gives you both the knowle
 dge and practice to confidently bake at home.\n\nYou’ll take home:\n\n
 • A lively sourdough starter to keep your baking journey going.\n\n• O
 ne pre-bulk fermented loaf\, shaped in class\, ready to bake the same day.
 \n\n• One freshly mixed boule to ferment overnight and bake the next day
 .
