DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260801T181500
UID:2607063-P9vF3MfkiEJzj5nOFglg
DESCRIPTION:Los-Angeles based Bardfly Theatre Company returns to Bees N Bl
 ooms\, to perform William Shakespeare's beloved comedy\, "As You Like It."
  Their unique\, immersive production will be performed right on the lawn i
 n the center of the Lavender Labyrinth. Come watch the Bard's incomparable
  heroine\, Rosalind\, abandon court life and run off to the  Forest of 
 Arden disguised as a man\, only to cross paths with her love interest\, Or
 lando. Gates open 5:30pm\, Show 6:30pm. Come early and picnic on the pavil
 ion! Outside food welcome. Beer and wine will be available for purchase. P
 lease note\, this production is not appropriate for children. Recommended 
 for ages 13+.
LOCATION:Bees N Blooms
URL:https://www.bardflytheatreco.com/shows.html
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
