UID:260612WJqOxc_iZUWs64cZEB-2YQ
DESCRIPTION:John Salaway is a top 20 Billboard charting songwriter\, Nashv
 ille producer & recording artist who was recently in consideration for a G
 rammy award for “Best American Roots” song. Salaway has shared the sta
 ge with Peter Frampton\, Denny Laine\, Anderson East\, and many more. His 
 recent album “Salvation” features musicians from Lynyrd Skynyrd\, The 
 Foo Fighters\, Smashing Pumpkins\, Cage the Elephant and more!\n\n\\*Salaw
 ay has shared the stage or studio with: Peter Frampton\, Ben Folds\, Charl
 es Esten\, Moon Taxi\, Anderson East\, Grace Bowers\, Zach Williams\, The 
 SteelDrivers\, Blessing Offor\, Heidi Newfield\, The Zombies\, Steve Cropp
 er \\(Stax/The Blues Brothers\\) Denny Laine \\(Moody Blues/Paul McCartney
  & Wings\\)\, The Wild Feathers\, Vince Herman\, Geoff Emerick \\(Beatles 
 studio engineer\\)\, Joey Molland \\(Badfinger\\)\, Gordon Kennedy \\(Gart
 h Brooks band\\)\, Rami Jaffee \\(Foo Fighters\\)\, Peter Keys \\(Lynyrd S
 kynyrd\\)\, Lincoln Parish \\(Cage the Elephant\\)\, Katie Cole \\(Smashin
 g Pumpkins\\)\, Troy Luccketta \\(Tesla\\)\, Kenny Olsen \\(Kid Rock\\)\, 
 Stuart Mathis \\(the Wallflowers\\) & many more!\n\nhttps://linktr.ee/john
 salaway
