DESCRIPTION:*Where unforgettable wines\, live music\, and good vibes come 
 together.*\n\nJoin us every Saturday from 3–6 PM at Spicy Vines for a ta
 sting room experience like no other — where top local musicians from acr
 oss the Bay Area meet our award-winning small-lot wines. From Rock & Roll 
 and Blues to Jazz\, Bluegrass\, and Americana\, each weekend brings new so
 unds and new reasons to raise a glass. \n\n**The Jeremy Gorman Project**\
 n\nJeremy Gorman is a versatile guitarist and singer-songwriter whose sou
 lful blend of rock\, blues\, folk\, and jam-band influences creates music 
 that’s both timeless and alive. With roots in New Orleans and a musical 
 journey that’s taken him across genres and stages\, Jeremy delivers hear
 tfelt performances full of groove\, grit\, and spirit.\n\n**Details**\n\nN
 o cover. Walk-ins are welcome\, but this event tends to fill up quickly\, 
 so we recommend making a reservation. We are dog and family friendly!
LOCATION:Spicy Vines Winery
URL:https://spicyvines.com/event/
