 rop out of summer and beat the heat? The Napa Valley Museum Yountville has
  exciting exhibits including Lucy Liu: One of These Things Is Not Like the
  Others\, the first U.S. museum exhibition of paintings and sculpture by L
 ucy Liu\, the artist\, actress and advocate. Liu has created an impressive
