DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T150000
UID:260703m0Y6zsvEB0KGdWcR9DK4Zg
DESCRIPTION:Lenormand - A system of cartomancy\, similar in purpose to Tar
 ot\, but more direct & focused with a practical approach. It's known for p
 roviding clear\, concise information about everyday situations & events.\n
 \nCome learn the history\, magic & meaning\n\nLearn & practice 3 & 5 card 
 layout\, 9 card portrait & we’ll touch upon Grand Tableau\n\nParticipant
 s take home a Lenormand deck\, Lenormand stickers\, & small journal\n\nNam
 ed after famous French cartomancer Marie Anne Adelaide Lenormand\, who gai
 ned fame during the Napoleonic era. She read for leaders of the French rev
 olution\, Empress Josephine\, & Tsar Alexander I
