BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sonoma Sundays on the Plaza - Huney Knuckles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260802T170000
UID:260508Q5ShBCOHoE-z5V7gP0PZNg
DESCRIPTION:This summer\, Music in Place and the City of Sonoma invite you
  to soak up the sunshine\, sip local wine\, and dance to live music at the
  Sonoma Plaza Grinstead Amphitheater during Sonoma Sundays On the Plaza\, 
 a free concert series running June 7 through October 4\, 2026.\n\nThis wee
 k's lineup features Huney Knuckles! With the left hand keyboard bass wizar
 dry of Kevin Wong along with the indomitable pocket of Darian Gray \\(tour
 ing drummer for Booker T Jones for the past 14 years\\)\, the Huney Knuckl
 es are undisputedly known as “the best band in the bay right now”\, el
 evated to electrifying heights by the lighting fast solos of virtuoso guit
 arist Brian Sheu along with the world class musicianship of grammy award w
 inning saxophonist Tony Peebles. Fusing watertight grooves with high energ
 y shreds that will make you want to jump out of your seat\, this 4-piece i
 nstrumental powerhouse has made a huge noise in the local scene\, serving 
 up soulful compositions\, mind bending solos\, & insanely funky jams at th
 e highest level possible.\n\nSonoma Sundays are free and open to all\, tha
 nks to the generous support of the Sonoma Community Center\, The Dawn Redw
 oods Trust\, and the McNeely Family Foundation.\n\nPack your picnic\, brin
 g your dancing shoes\, and meet us on the Plaza!
LOCATION:Grinstead Amphitheater
URL:https://musicinplace.org/event/sonoma-sundays-on-the-plaza-8-2/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
