 orkshops\n\nExperience Level\n\nAll Levels\n\nAges\n\n18 and older\n\nRegi
 stration Cost:\n\n$40\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$5\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\
 n\n$45\n\nIn this workshop\, New Yorker magazine cartoonist Hilary Fitzger
 ald Campbell will teach you how to find humor and inspiration in your day-
 to-day life and translate it into relatable\, well-crafted and funny carto
 ons. This class is suitable for all levels – no drawing expertise requir
 ed – perfect for friend groups or a date night! Repeat students welcome.
  All materials \\(paper\, ink\, watercolors\, etc.\\) are provided through
  the materials fee.
