DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T200000
UID:260609m5lf2yaPxkiSRCGlzqC-ig
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for a fun night of Trivia\, craft beer and varyin
 g food trucks every Wednesday 6-8pm. The game consist of several rounds of
