BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Library Commission Regular Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260805T210000
UID:260722n9k6XaQ1Wk-LSSTt957ojQ
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Library Headquarters will host the Regular Libra
 ry Commission meeting. The Sonoma County Library Commission is an 11-perso
 n body responsible for governing the library. Commissioners are appointed 
 by the cities in Sonoma County and the county Board of Supervisors. The co
 mmission establishes policy\; sets goals and objectives\; hires and evalua
 tes the director\; establishes and monitors the annual budget\; and exerci
 ses such other powers\, consistent with the law to foster the effective us
 e and management of the library. The commission generally meets monthly\, 
 with additional special meetings as needed. Meetings are open to the publi
 c and recordings are accessible online through
