SUMMARY:Art Nite Healdsburg - Music and Mocktails
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T190000
UID:2607287eJFQ8DPiEu0Ef42smUVrQ
DESCRIPTION:Art Nite / Noche del Arte Healdsburg Returns August 6 with “
 Music and Mocktails”\n\nHealdsburg Comes Alive with Art\, Live Performan
 ces\, and Creative Sips\n\nHealdsburg\, CA — On Thursday\, August 6\, He
 aldsburg’s monthly Art Nite returns from 5–7 p.m. with this month's th
 eme: Music and Mocktails!Downtown galleries\, venues\, and pop-ups will op
 en their doors for an evening of art\, community\, and celebration. Local 
 shops\, wineries\, and restaurants will offer special perks throughout the
  evening\, showcasing Healdsburg’s creative spirit. Art Nite is a free\,
  first-Thursday tradition in Healdsburg running from April through Decembe
 r.\n\nThis month’s event will spotlight an exciting lineup of performing
  artists\, including:Marcos Pereda\, John Youngblood\, Troubleshootin'\, O
 live Munden\, Brazilian Jazz \\(Jobim\\)\, Flute Fusion Duo\, and The Magn
 olias.Guests can also enjoy handcrafted mocktails provided by Land and Loc
 al\, adding a fresh and festive touch to the art-filled stroll through tow
 n.\n\nArt Nite Healdsburg is proudly sponsored by Stay Healdsburg\, the He
 aldsburg Chamber of Commerce\, and Kalderra.August 6 promises to be a vibr
 ant\, creative\, and unforgettable summer night in downtown Healdsburg. Wh
 ether you come for the galleries\, the performances\, the drinks\, or the 
 community atmosphere\, Art Nite is the perfect way to celebrate local cult
 ure.\n\nEvent Details:\n\nWhat: Art Nite Healdsburg — “Music and Mockt
 ails” \n\nWhen: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\, from 5–7 p.m. \n\nWhere
 : Downtown Healdsburg galleries\, venues\, restaurants\, and shops \n\nAd
 mission: Free  -\n\nFeaturing: Performing artists\, visual arts\, and Lan
 d and Local mocktails\n\nAttendees can pick up a map at any participating 
 venue and collect passport stamps to enjoy perks at local restaurants. For
  additional information\, please visit https://www.artnitehealdsburg.com.
LOCATION:Downtown Healdsburg Galleries\, Shops and Restaurants
URL:https://www.artnitehealdsburg.com/about-3
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
