DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260806T200000
UID:260609VbBXY3ByPEinbcsoDxwNmQ
DESCRIPTION:Come Join us for a family fun evening of CLASSIC BINGO at Moon
 light Brewing Company Every Thursday from 6-8pm. No entry fee needed. Just
  show up and dab your cards to possibly win some $MOON BUCKS$. This is a f
 amily friendly environment\, and littles have the chance to win from the k
