 iner Terry Dorsey!\n\nVIP TABLES NOW AVAILABLE! Snag a table for 4 with pr
 eferred seating\, your own private call button to summon service\, and you
 r first round of beer/cider (or a bottle of wine) for only $95!\n\nEvery F
 riday night hilarious comedians from The Bay Area and beyond perform at Ba
 rrel Proof Lounge. Stick around after for late-night karaoke! Fresh lineup
  of funny each Friday.\n\n(Don Lacy rescheduled for October 9th)\n\nThis W
 eek: Tony Sparks (host) Mitch Norton Jen Pierdant Headliner: Terry Dorsey\
 n\nBarrel Proof welcomes back one of our most popular comedians\, Terry Do
 rsey!\n\nTerry Dorsey is a comedian and actor from Illinois. He has also p
 erformed as "Shady" in a solo act and as part of the comic duo "Tu Shay De
 ." His style of comedy leans more towards storytelling with added social c
 ommentary. He started his career on Chicago's south side being trained by 
