 p was in 2000 on BET's Comicview\, but he has also appeared on Jamie Foxx'
 s Laffapalooza. Terry was also part of the development team that launched 
 the "Laff Zone Comedy Club" in the Chicago suburb of Markham. Terry brings
  his Heavyweight Comedy throughout California and the Bay Area and all the
  comedy clubs like Improv and Punch Line. Check him out on instagram @tdfu
 nny2 21+ Doors - 6:30pm / Show - 7:30pm $15adv / $20door\n\nCheck out **ww
 w.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good times ahead.
