BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Katie Phillips\, Karen Joy Brown and Little Door @ The Lost Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260807T230000
UID:2607197_UhX_UloEyHLOIQCHE0GA
DESCRIPTION:Songwriters in the round with indie/folk/singer songwriters\n\
 nKaren Joy Brown Karen Joy Brown's elegantly sparse pop/Americana guitar a
 nd deeply soulful voice disarm listeners with raw emotional honesty that i
 nspires reflection and connection. Literate lyrics reveal a poet's soul wi
 th a singular sense of rhythm\, humor and compassion that leaves listeners
  feeling uplifted and finally understood. www.karenjoybrown.com www.instag
 ram.com/karenjoybrowncreates\n\nKatie Phillips Singer-songwriter with a vo
 ice that stops you in your tracks and songs that stick in your ribcage lon
 g after the last note fades. Recognized for her extraordinary vocal gift s
 ince childhood\, Katie carries her father's words close: that one of life'
 s greatest honors would be using her voice as sacred offering to those she
  loves. Drawing from a kaleidoscope of influences\, Katie crafts visceral 
 songwriting that creates narrative universes you immediately inhabit. With
  virtuosic melodies and high craft\, she plunges you into her most vulnera
 ble worries\, pains\, and tender loves\, each song startlingly intimate an
 d specific. www.instagram.com/katiepsingsasong\n\nlittle door begins with 
 a simple idea: each person is a portal into deep consciousness\, and music
  is one way to open that door — or leave it ajar. Rooted in psych-folk a
 nd cosmic groove\, her acoustic performances draw on themes of awakening\,
  motherhood\, love\, and the tender\, unspoken corners of the psyche. Unhu
 rried and embodied\, her live sets are the kind you feel as much as hear 
 — an invitation to arrive fully in yourself. www.littledoormusic.com www
 .instagram.com/littledoor.music\n\nRecommended If You Like: Fiona Apple\,
  Annie Lennox\, Brandie Carlile\, Jenny Lewis\, CMAT\, Lana Del Rey\, Waxa
 hatchee\, Mazzy Star\, Lucinda Williams\n\nEarlybirds!\n\n$3 off each tick
 et when you use the code earlybird5 at checkout. Offer ends August 2nd.
 \n\nPromo Codes are not applicable at the door.\n\nCodes are not case s
 ensitive\, but must be typed as one word.
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://tinyurl.com/PhillipsJoyBrownlittledoor
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Roller Disco Daze
