 hubs. Local Dj WOLVERINE plus special guests perform three to 12 hour radi
 o show called Thee HOLY COW SHOW enumerating the greatness of BOB plus Psy
 chedelic treatment of popular bass music . Created and maintained at Burni
 ng man at BMIR at the Yearly Burning Man Festival . Plus 24/7 music on Sho
 utingfire.com . Always bringing in randomes for the show to sing\, talk\, 
 dance\, Dj or serve their master.
