DESCRIPTION:Friday Music/Poetry Open Mic Happy Hour\n\nEvery Friday | 5:00
  PM - 7:30 PM\n\nLooking for a music open mic in Santa Rosa? Come spend Ha
 ppy Hour with us every Friday at Barrel Proof Lounge\, where local musicia
 ns\, poets\, songwriters\, and creatives take over the stage.\n\nWhether y
 ou're performing your latest song\, reading a poem\, trying stand-up story
 telling\, or just enjoying the atmosphere\, everyone is welcome.\n\nDon't 
 have an instrument?\n\nWe've got you covered.\n\nUnlike most open mics\, w
 e provide a full backline\, so you can show up and perform without hauling
  your entire setup across town.\n\nAvailable equipment includes:\n\n 3-pi
 ece drum kit\n\n Electric & acoustic guitars\n\n Banjo\n\n Mandolin\n\n
  Professional microphones\n\n Full PA and sound system\n\nJust bring you
 r talent (or your courage) and we'll help with the rest.\n\nPerformance Ti
 mes\n\n Music — up to 10 minutes\n\n Poetry & Spoken Word — 5-7 minu
 tes\n\nOriginal music\, cover songs\, spoken word\, storytelling\, folk\, 
 punk\, indie\, Americana\, blues\, country\, rock\, experimental... if it 
 belongs on a stage\, we want to hear it.\n\nJust Want to Listen?\n\nGrab a
  drink\, relax\, and discover local talent during Happy Hour. Every week b
 rings new performers\, new songs\, and new voices. It's a great way to mee
 t other musicians\, connect with the local arts community\, or simply enjo
 y live entertainment before your Friday night gets started.\n\nEvent Detai
 ls\n\nEvery Friday\n\n5:00 PM - 7:30 PM\n\nFREE Admission\n\n1-2 Drink Min
 imum\n\n21+\n\nBarrel Proof Lounge\n\nDowntown Santa Rosa\n\nRespect the s
 pace.\n\nSupport local artists.\n\nCheck out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com**
  for all sorts of good times ahead!\n\nSupport your local venue.
