SUMMARY:One Tam Guided Hike Series - "Rooted In The Watershed"
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T130000
UID:260626Eei5PzOsu0-mG4J_bUitCw
DESCRIPTION:Join One Tam staff for our summer Rooted in the Watershed guid
 ed hike series\, where we travel from peak to Pacific through the forests
  of Marin County. Starting on Mt. Tamalpais\, we will follow the water all
  the way out to Lagunitas Creek\, stopping at several forest types on the
  way. This series encourages folks to reflect upon how our parks are conne
 cted through the watershed they share\, and how\, through collaborative ma
 nagement\, we can foster more resilient landscapes. \n\nFollow the link t
 o our google sign up form. There\, you can read more about the events in m
 ore detail and get your name on the sign up. We will reach out a couple w
 eeks before your hike to provide more logistics about specific locatio
 n\, parking\, and trail distance. \n\nWe hope you will join us!
LOCATION:Mt. Tamalpais
URL:https://forms.gle/bvqegQYdpbvLwqncA
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
