BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:H&L Live: Burrows & Dilbeck
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T183000
UID:260607M4eL_eo7J0-KlMslwa5q-A
DESCRIPTION:H&L Live: Burrows & Dilbeck\n\nGet ready for an evening of sou
 l\, funk\, and masterful songwriting as Burrows & Dilbeck take the stage f
 or H&L Live.\n\nSpencer Burrows and Kris Dilbeck are the powerhouse duo be
 hind North Bay's legendary super-funk-rock band Frobeck\, which earned two
  North Bay Music Awards over their 13-year run. These Sonoma State Univers
 ity and Berklee College of Music alumni have opened for internationally kn
 own acts including WAR\, Los Lonely Boys\, Ivan Neville's Dumpstaphunk\, B
 ootsy Collins\, and the Sons of Champlin.\n\nWith seven full-length albums
  under their belt\, Burrows and Dilbeck have harnessed their soul\, funk\,
  and pop-rock influences into a unique sound that's earned praise from mus
 ic legends. Bill Champlin of Chicago calls Spencer "one of the best singer
 s I've ever heard... ever\," while Emilio Castillo of Tower of Power prais
 es their "powerful vocals" and "real strong songwriting."\n\nAfter retirin
 g the Frobeck name in 2018\, this duo dug deeper into their passion for so
 ngwriting and performing—creating music that speaks loudest to their sou
 ls. Now they're bringing that passion to our vineyard stage.\n\nWhat to Kn
 ow:\n\nAdmission is free - just show up and enjoy\n\nPizza & Chill Red: Fr
 esh wood-fired pizza paired with our new Chill Red\n\nOutdoor seating - La
 wn and picnic area available \\(bring blankets encouraged\\)\n\nAll ages w
 elcome - Family-friendly event\n\nWine available for purchase by the glass
  or bottle\n\nThis is H&L Live at its best: world-class musicians\, golden
  hour timing\, and the Russian River Valley as your backdrop. Come early\,
  stay late\, and experience why the North Bay music scene is legendary.\n\
 nLearn more about Burrows & Dilbeck: burrowsanddilbeck.com
LOCATION:Hook & Ladder Winery
URL:https://www.hookandladderwinery.com/event/hl-live-burrows-dilbeck
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
