SUMMARY:Beach Party Camp - Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T083000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260810T143000
UID:260514dBigaCrZW0mE_QR7xMFaKQ
DESCRIPTION:Make the most of summer with award-winning Gymnastics Camps at
  SGA! Keep children’s bodies and brains active with careful guidance fro
 m our trained instructors\, and have some fun\, too. We’ll play in our o
 utdoor inflatable water parks\, eat lunch in the park\, and learn basic gy
 mnastics techniques every day from 8:30 AM - 2:30 PM. Each week has its ow
 n unique theme with specialized crafts\, games\, activities\, and learning
 . Enroll in one week\, a few\, or all ten! Sign up on our site\, email us\
 , or call us to register. Spots are limited.\n\n**\\-This week’s theme i
 s: BEACH PARTY WEEK!-**\n\n*Stay cool while things heat up this summer at 
 Beach Party week! Get immersed in beach life with our very own outdoor inf
 latable water park! Spend the day in the gym with games like beach volleyb
 all\, frisbee\, and mat surfing. Get crafty with beach-inspired crafts\, l
 earn about the ocean\, make new friends\, and learn some new groovy dance 
 moves! It’s the unforgettable party of the Summer.*\n\nCamps are best su
 ited for children ages 4 to 12. All participants must be fully toilet-trai
 ned.\n\nStudents should wear a t-shirt with elastic waistband shorts/pants
 \, or a leotard. Long hair must be pulled back. No jewelry\, jeans\, dress
 es\, or skirts. Please wear or pack clothing layers for if the weather per
 mits us to adventure outside!\n\nPlease pack your child(ren) a PEANUT-FREE
  lunch\, water bottle\, and comfortable shoes. Morning snacks will be prov
 ided.
LOCATION:Sonoma Gymnastics Academy
URL:https://sonomagymnasticsacademy.com/camps/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
