DESCRIPTION:MOVIE MONDAY DOWNTOWN SANTA ROSA: So I Married an Axe Murderer
   Featuring Mike Myers in one of his most beloved 90s roles\, portions of 
 the film were shot in Santa Rosa\, including scenes at the historic Luther
  Burbank Home & Gardens. Its quirky tone and local backdrop make it a perf
 ect fit for Santa Rosa’s Summer on the Square. Grab dinner downtown\, br
 ing your blankets and lawn chairs\, and join us for another unforgettable 
 Movie Monday.  FREE admission  Activities at 4 PM  Movie begins around 6 P
 M  Thank you to our amazing sponsors and partners for helping bring this f
 ree community event series to life: Poppy Bank\, Kaiser Permanente\, Keysi
 ght Technologies\, Sutter Health\, Dave & Buster’s\, Dax Entertainment L
 LC\, Stellar XP\, Inc.\, and Wine Country Radio stations KRSH 95.9\, The D
 rive 95.5\, Latino 100.9\, Exitos 98.7\, and BOB FM 96.7.  \\#SummerOnTheS
