 reat American traditions: baseball and wine. Settle in with Priest Ranch w
 ines\, delicious food from The Kitchen at Priest Ranch\, and an entertaini
 ng conversation featuring KNBR’s Marty Lurie and longtime San Francisco 
 Giants coach Ron Wotus as they share behind-the-scenes stories\, unforgett
 able moments\, and insights from decades in the game. Your ticket includes
  admission to the exclusive discussion with Marty and Ron\, along with a c
 omplimentary glass of Sauvignon Blanc or a non-alcoholic beverage. Additio
 nal wines by the glass and bottle\, as well as food from The Kitchen at Pr
 iest Ranch\, will be available for purchase throughout the evening.\n\nPri
 ce: $40 General | $30 Members
