BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Place To Grow Old: Film Screening & Panel Discussion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260813T200000
UID:2607282Snraz82xUiAtCyv1DYlWA
DESCRIPTION:On Thursday\, August 13\, join the San Geronimo Valley Commun
 ity Center\, Two Valleys Community Land Trust and Marin AgeWell Collaborat
 ive for a free special screening of No Place to Grow Old\, a thought-prov
 oking documentary that explores the growing challenges older adults face i
 n finding safe\, affordable housing and maintaining dignity as they age. T
 hrough personal stories and expert perspectives\, the film examines the co
 mplex realities of aging\, housing insecurity\, and the importance of comm
 unity support. Following the screening\, a panel of local advocates and pr
 ofessionals will lead a discussion on how these issues are affecting older
  adults in Marin County and the ways our community can work together to cr
 eate more inclusive\, age-friendly solutions. Audience members will be inv
 ited to participate in the conversation and share their own questions and 
 perspectives.
LOCATION:San Geronimo Valley Communiy Center
URL:https://sgvperformingarts.eventcalendarapp.com/no-place-to-grow-old-fi
 lm-screening-and-panel-discussion-1
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
