BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Safari West Presents! Save the Turtles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T200000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260814T203000
UID:260723WznKj4EHJ06PCuZlv4xXCw
DESCRIPTION:Conservation Dinner Series: Kelly Beffa of  Save the Turtles j
 oins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a talk about sea turtles
 . The conservation dinner series is complimentary to all dinner guests. If
  you would like to just go to this presentation\, please call our reservat
 ions team at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695 and they can book it
  for you. Dinner starts at 7:00 PM.    Save the Turtles is a true all-volu
 nteer grass-roots organization. Since our conception\, no one has received
  any salaries\, and the donations we receive are dedicated to the direct p
 rotection of endangered sea turtles and their eggs. Although we have assis
 ted different regions over the last 20 years\, currently we send grants to
  projects safeguarding sea turtles from poachers in Costa Rican and Nicara
 guan projects where poaching is extreme. Our mission includes financial su
 pport to the local turtle patrollers who protect the vulnerable nesting tu
 rtles on the beach at night\, a dangerous job. We send grants whenever pos
 sible for their challenging work. Providing salaries also benefits the loc
 als in the small communities to embrace conservation\, attaining a more su
 stainable life. Saving different species of nesting sea turtles allows for
  future generations. Turtle patrollers also safeguard hatchlings until the
 y catch their first wave and begin their new journey into the ocean.
LOCATION:Safari West
URL:https://www.safariwest.com/calendar/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
