BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Amina Figarova Sextet featuring Bart Platteau
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260815T210000
UID:260728M-__rFVuikqDEgIK37Dsog
DESCRIPTION:Amina Figarova brings her celebrated sextet to the stage for o
 pening night of the 2026-2027 season with brand-new music from her upcomin
 g album Flying High Above\, including the Havana Suite inspired by her rec
 ent trip to Cuba. Figarova is a phenomenal Azerbaijan born\, New York and 
 New Orleans based pianist and accomplished composer. Her sextet includes B
 art Platteau on flutes\, Ryan Ancheta on trumpet\, Paloma Ximenaon tenor s
 axophone\, Amina Scott on bass and Ferenc Nemeth on drums. The sextet is k
 nown for their remarkable chemistry and vivid\, globally influenced arrang
 ements\, Figarova and her ensemble create a rich\, immersive sound that ha
 s captivated audiences at festivals from Newport to New Orleans. Expect an
  evening of fresh compositions\, expressive interplay\, and world-class ar
 tistry. Amina has toured extensively\, developing a tight-knit ensemble th
 at has attained a distinctive and inimitable voice by concentrating on all
 -original repertoire for almost 30 years. Amina's pieces strike a perfect 
 tone\, employing genuinely beautiful harmonizations\, to capture fleeting 
 thoughts that accompany those precious moments when the puzzling jostle of
  daily existence comes into unexpected but deeply satisfying sync.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/amina-figarova-sextet-featuring-bart-
 platteau/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
