BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Brunch in the Vineyards with Chef Heather Hardcastle
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T133000
UID:260722H-q6OT1yYE6FzjMFVGJMMQ
DESCRIPTION:Brunch in the Vineyards with Chef Heather Hardcastle\n\nSunday
 \, August 16\, 2026 | 11:30 a.m. – 1:30 p.m. Bennett Lane Winery | Calis
 toga\, CA\n\nTicket price options - $100 per person \\(does not include co
 py of the cookbook\\)\; $130 per person \\(includes copy of The Flour Cra
 ft Bakery & Café Cookbook\\)\n\nTicket link - https://www.cellarpass.com
 /events/brunch-in-the-vineyards-with-chef-heather-hardcastle-12399 \n\nSpe
 nd a leisurely Sunday at Bennett Lane Winery\, where award-winning wines\,
  vineyard views\, and seasonal California cuisine come together for an unf
 orgettable wine country brunch.\n\nJoin Bennett Lane Winery and acclaimed 
 chef Heather Hardcastle\, founder of Flour Craft Bakery & Café\, for an i
 ntimate outdoor gathering celebrating the flavors of Napa Valley. Set amon
 g the vineyards\, guests will enjoy a thoughtfully curated brunch inspired
  by recipes from The Flour Craft Bakery & Café Cookbook\, with each cour
 se paired with Bennett Lane's acclaimed wines.\n\nKnown for transforming t
 he way people think about gluten-free cuisine\, Heather has spent more tha
 n 15 years creating beautiful\, seasonal food that everyone can enjoy. Ins
 pired by California's summer harvest\, this special menu showcases fresh\,
  local ingredients and proves that exceptional food can be both naturally 
 gluten-free and incredibly delicious.\n\nThroughout the afternoon\, Heathe
 r will host a live culinary demonstration\, sharing her approach to season
 al cooking while preparing her refreshing Yellow Tomato Gazpacho and assem
 bling her decadent Chocolate Blackberry Layer Cake. Guests will also have 
 the opportunity to meet Heather\, ask questions\, and purchase their own c
 opy of The Flour Craft Bakery & Café Cookbook \\(as well as get it pers
 onally signed\\). Note - ticket cost does not include a copy of the book.
  \n\nWhether you're a wine enthusiast\, an avid home cook\, gluten-free\,
  or simply looking for the perfect Sunday in Napa Valley\, this intimate g
 athering is a celebration of exceptional wine\, seasonal ingredients\, and
  the joy of sharing a meal in one of Calistoga's most picturesque vineyard
  settings.\n\nSeasonal Brunch Menu\n\nSummer Vegetable Quiche\n\nStone Fru
 it\, Pistachio & Burrata Salad\n\nYellow Tomato Gazpacho\n\nRosemary & Oli
 ve Focaccia\n\nChocolate Blackberry Layer Cake\n\nYour ticket includes:\n\
 nA seasonal multi-course brunch by Chef Heather Hardcastle and Flour Craft
  Bakery & Café\n\nCurated Bennett Lane wine pairings\n\nA live culinary d
 emonstration with Heather Hardcastle\n\nMeet-and-greet with Heather follow
 ing the demonstration\n\nA relaxing afternoon surrounded by the vineyards 
 at Bennett Lane Winery
LOCATION:Bennett Lane Winery
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/brunch-in-the-vineyards
 -with-chef-heather-hardcastle/19434584/2026-08-16T11
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
