BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sundays in Sonoma at Viansa Winery
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T000000
UID:260624oeasMs0blkK1P4qWLVAp0w
DESCRIPTION:Viansa Winery feels made for live music\, perched atop the Sum
 mit of Sonoma with sweeping vineyard views and Tuscan-inspired charm. This
  summer and fall\, acclaimed singer-songwriter Greg Lamboy brings his warm
 \, intimate sound to the hilltop terrace for select afternoon performances
  as part of Viansa's outdoor music series. An award-winning guitarist and 
 frontman of the Americana band Pacific Standard\, Lamboy is known for pitc
 h-perfect melodies and deeply personal lyrics. His relaxed\, soulful style
  pairs effortlessly with Viansa's panoramic setting\, estate wines\, and l
 aid-back elegance. Settle in with a tasting\, take in the views\, and enjo
 y an afternoon where strong vocals\, masterful guitar\, and unforgettable 
 songs rise above the everyday. Performance Dates: June 14\, June 21\, July
  12\, July 19\, July 26\, October 4\, and October 18 from 12 pm -3 pm.
LOCATION:Viansa Winery
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/sundays-in-sonoma-at-viansa-winery/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Overeaters Anonymous (OA) Meeting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260816T103000
UID:260728C-QCrXyBYEmrLWjlWouh5Q
DESCRIPTION:Is Food a Problem for You? You Are Not Alone.\n\nIn OA\, membe
 rs experience spiritual\, emotional\, and physical recovery by practicing 
 the Twelve Steps and living by their spiritual principles—one day at a t
 ime.\n\nOvereaters Anonymous (OA) is a fellowship of people who support ea
 ch other in recovering from compulsive eating and food behaviors. If you f
 eel you have a problem with food\, OA welcomes you—no matter what your b
 ackground\, beliefs\, or eating habits. \n\nWe hold an in-person meetings
  at 9:30 on Sunday mornings at Church of the Nazarene\, 18980 Arnold Drive
 \, Sonoma\, CA (a small room directly off of parking lot\; look for the si
 gn posted) and newcomers are always welcome.\n\nYou may view all North Bay
  OA in-person and online meetings at https://www.northbayoa.org/meetings.h
 tml\n\nOA is not a diet club or calorie-counting program.\n\nMembers have 
 different plans of eating.\n\nOA does not endorse any specific food plan.
  \n\nVisit: https://www.northbayoa.org/\n\nFind a meeting: https://www.no
 rthbayoa.org/meetings.html
LOCATION:Church of the Nazarene  (a small room directly off of parking lot
 \; look for the sign posted)
URL:https://www.northbayoa.org/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
