SUMMARY:Developing Your Drawing Eye
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260817T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260817T130000
UID:260627gr31dRftC0qxjUXqqD8yaA
DESCRIPTION:Mondays Weekly · 6 Weeks\n\nDate & Time\n\nJuly 13 – August
  24\, 2026\n\n10:00 AM – 1:00 PM\n\nLocation\n\nRoom 208\n\nCategory\n\n
 Drawing & Painting\, Extended Classes\n\nExperience Level\n\nBeginning\n\n
 Ages\n\n18 and older\n\nRegistration Cost:\n\n$270\n\nMaterials Fee:\n\n$1
 0\n\nTotal Registration Cost:\n\n$280\n\nIt’s never too late to learn to
  draw – especially when nobody’s grading you. Whether you are an abjec
 t beginner\, haven’t picked up a pencil since high school\, or you’re 
 a creative who has always felt intimidated by observational drawing\, this
  six-week class is offered with you in mind.We’ll take the mystery – a
 nd the pressure – out of drawing from observation. You’ll learn how to
  really see like an artist\, practice simple techniques step by step\, and
  build skills at your own pace. No talent required\, and perfection is off
  the table.Studying observational drawing offers a foundational skill set 
 that you will carry into every medium you might wish to explore. Discover 
 the joy of drawing and build practical skills to expand your creative expr
 ession!All materials are provided.
LOCATION:Sonoma Community Center
URL:https://sonomacommunitycenter.org/programs/developing-your-drawing-eye
 /
