DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T173000
UID:260603BjCco1LebEKwZExcJHUu6g
DESCRIPTION:Summer can bring a mix of freedom and uncertainty—more unstr
 uctured time\, shifting routines\, and social pressures that don’t take 
 a break. Our summer groups are designed to offer a supportive space where 
 teens and young adults can stay connected\, build skills\, and feel unders
 tood during this transition.\n\nAt Juniper & Jade Psychotherapy\, we belie
 ve growth happens in connection. These groups provide a safe\, therapist-l
 ed environment where participants can explore their experiences\, strength
 en relationships\, and build confidence in themselves.
LOCATION:Juniper & Jade Psychotherapy Inc
URL:https://juniperandjadepsychotherapy.com/group-therapy
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Music Illuminated: Rachmaninoff Revealed
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260818T190000
UID:2606019X6nneGRA0u-KTwTpuPP0A
DESCRIPTION:Music Illuminated is an inspiring series of presentations that
  go beyond the notes on the page and uncover the stories behind classical 
 music. Concert Host Michael Adams will be joined by the brilliant cello an
 d piano duo of Edward Arron and Jeewon Park as they explore the world of o
 ne of the last great Russian Romantics\, Sergei Rachmaninoff. Note: This M
 usic Illuminated event will be held at a private residence in St. Helena. 
