UID:260724pgnUFnOZOE-QpB75Plj4bg
DESCRIPTION:GET TICKETS HERE : https://www.ticketor.com/.../iv-the-strange
 -band-clownvis...\n\nThe "Outlaws and Oddballs" tour combines the gritty c
 ountry-rock of IV and The Strange Band \\(fronted by Coleman Williams\, gr
 eat-grandson of Hank Williams\\) with the bizarre comedy-lounge act of Clo
 wnvis . This tour promises a high-energy mix of dark country\, Southern ro
 ck\, and satirical performance.\n\n- About IV and The Strange Band: Known 
 for intense live shows\, their sound blends traditional country storytelli
 ng with rock and metal influences\, often described as "metal-country." - 
 About Clownvis: Dubbed "The King of Clowns\," Clownvis Presley blends Elvi
 s-style showmanship with raunchy comedy\, original music\, and celebrity i
 mpressions.\n\nAge Restrictions: 21\\+ Doors Open: 6pm Show Time: 7pm Pres
 ale $25-General Admission Location: Barrel Proof Lounge\, 501 Mendocino Av
 enue\, Santa Rosa\, CA 95401\n\nCheck out www.BarrelProofLounge.com for al
 l sorts of good times ahead!
LOCATION:Barrel Proof Lounge
URL:https://www.eventbrite.com/e/iv-the-strange-band-clownvis-downtown-san
 ta-rosa-aug-20-tickets-1993717395399?aff=oddtdtcreator
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rockin' the River: Concert & Night Market at the Guerneville Plaza
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260820T210000
UID:260721MKVUctVrtUakTV_nljLeZg
DESCRIPTION:Rockin' the River’s 15th annual high octane concert series a
 t the historic Guerneville Plaza returns for one music-filled night on Thu
 rsday\, August 20th. \n\nA family-friendly\, dancin'-in-the-street party\
 , Rockin' the River kicks off at 6:00pm with the off-the-charts 3-part har
 monies and instrumental talents of the all-female quintet\, Foxes in the H
 enhouse performing original renditions of familiar classics\, followed at 
 7:15pm by the one-woman powerhouse\, Tami Gosnell. Eddie and the Fog take 
 the stage from 7:45 to 9pm playing classic rock\, rhythm and blues\, funk\
 , disco\, and country hits from the 1960s to early 2000s. This line-up is 
 sure to bring you to your feet and keep you there!\n\nHot Box BBQ and Smar
 t Pizza will be on hand to provide food breaks.\n\nAnd new this year\, sta
 rting at 5pm\, the Russian River Chamber of Commerce is bringing a Night M
 arket to the walking bridge! Stroll the bridge to browse arts\, crafts and
  curiosities. Lots of fun activities for the whole family.\n\nGrab your fr
 iends and family\, strap on your dancing shoes\, and come on down!
LOCATION:The Guerneville Plaza
URL:http://www.rockintheriver.net
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
