 r joins us in the elephant room after dinner to give a talk about sea otte
 rs. The conservation dinner series is complimentary to all dinner guests. 
 If you want to attend this presentation\, please call our reservations tea
 m at \\(707\\) 566-3667 or \\(800\\) 616-2695 and they can book it for you
 . Dinner starts at 7:00 PM. Saving Sea Otters Sea otters are the smallest 
