UID:260728nq4M1DwneEOg1HKf5zvGSw
DESCRIPTION:*With Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, “The Kokedama Mama”*\
 n\nDiscover the Japanese art of kokedama—living plant arrangements wrapp
 ed in moss. Guided by Cathrina of Cat Hawk Gardens\, you’ll explore this
  mindful practice of balance\, beauty\, and simplicity while creating your
  own kokedama to take home.\n\n**In this workshop you’ll:**\n\n• Learn
  traditional techniques for forming and binding moss balls\n\n• Make you
 r own kokedama to take home\n\n• Gain skills to continue creating on yo
 ur own\n\nAll supplies provided. Includes a grounding Self-Breema movement
  practice to connect body and mind.
LOCATION:Gather Sebastopol
URL:https://gathersebastopol.com/products/the-art-of-kokedama
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
