 dual female vocalists and a dynamic horn section! Seductive flowing groove
 s\, medleys\, mashups and more will keep you on the dance floor!\n\n Sip 
 on beer\, wine\, and Soju cocktails .  Plus — free popcorn all night lo
 ng to keep the vibe poppin'!  Let’s get our groove on!  Tickets: Advan
 ce $20  Show starts at 8:00 PM  21+ only  Venue: Barrel Proof Lounge\, 
 501 Mendocino Ave\, Downtown Santa Rosa  Grab your tickets\, gather your 
 friends\, and dance into a fantastic night of live music!\n\n**#LiveMusic*
