BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Flamenco Audaz: Music and Dance of Spain
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260822T210000
UID:260715TP10RIrPIkuYUDNlv1-ZBA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the passion of flamenco with Sol Flamenco.This prof
 essional ensemble brings the heart of Spain directly to Sebastiani Theater
 . Once the show ignites\, prepare for a high-energy and authentic flamenco
  journey. Our artists have honed their craft in Spain\, the very birthplac
 e of flamenco. Witness the fiery footwork\, expressive movements\, soulful
  melodies\, and intricate rhythms that define this iconic art form. Sol Fl
 amenco delivers with an energy that will leave you breathless and exhilara
 ted. Dancers - Roberto Aguilar\, Claudia Barros-Morrison\, Joelle Gonçalv
 es plus Los Solecitos an 8-member dance group. Musicians - Flamenco Guitar
 ist Mark Taylor\, Singer Azriel "El Moreno" and Cajonero Mike Masauda. Thi
 s event is sponsored by Audacity Rising and all proceeds go to VIDAS law f
 irm in Sonoma County to aid the immigrant community by paying legal fees a
 nd providing support for families in need. Sol Flamencois an electrifying 
 evening of phenomenal music and dance. It will carry you into a world of p
 assion that is unique to flamenco. Olé! Come experience the passion of fl
 amenco close to home.
URL:https://creativesonoma.org/event/flamenco-audaz-music-and-dance-of-spa
 in/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
