UID:251210LRGf5yQd7kG6iMbt-NwFGg
DESCRIPTION:Annual bonsai show hosted by the Redwood Empire Bonsai Society
  \\(REBS\\) is the formal display of 80 bonsai trees at the Rohnert Park C
