SUMMARY:2025 Santa Rosa Marathon
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T070000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260823T070000
UID:260102wVX4C6l7jkqp4Z2EUIH8Pg
DESCRIPTION:Lace up your sneakers and grab your friends—it’s time to r
 un through the heart of California’s iconic wine country! Join us for th
 e 17th Annual Santa Rosa Marathon\, Half Marathon\, 10K & 5K on August 23r
 d & 24th\, 2025. Race through scenic vineyard-lined paths and picturesque 
 rolling hills\, all while enjoying mostly flat courses in stunning Sonoma 
 County. Wine A Little\, Run A Lot After giving it your all on the 5K\, 10K
 \, Half Marathon\, or Marathon route\, cross the finish line and head stra
 ight to the post-race celebration at Old Courthouse Square. 5K and 10K run
 ners will enjoy one complimentary beer\, while half marathon and marathon 
 runners receive two complimentary beers and a bottle of wine from DeLoach 
 Vineyards. Can’t make the live event? Run anytime\, anywhere with our vi
 rtual run! Don’t miss out on this unforgettable race through one of the 
 most beautiful regions in California. Register now!
LOCATION:Old Courthouse Square
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
