BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T170000
UID:260430n0HduJwhZ0CFWz_Hm8oyyw
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intermediate Salsa with Tyler
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260828T193000
UID:260319clx-hq7lQka2p28GcqJI0g
DESCRIPTION:Ready to learn intermediate steps and technique?\n\nAre you a 
 salsa dancer who has the basics down but is ready to add more? Our Interme
 diate Salsa Class with Tyler is designed to help you transform your dancin
 g moves. In this class\, you’ll go beyond the basics to learn intricate 
 footwork\, enhance your leading and following skills\, and master the body
  movement that will make you shine on the dance floor. This class is for a
 nyone ready to learn the techniques and intermediate steps needed to take 
 their dancing to the next level.\n\nYou’ll learn intermediate dancing te
 chniques that will help you:\n\nExpress yourself with sharper footwork and
  styling.\n\nMaster complex turn patterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen 
 your lead and follow for seamless\, connected dancing.\n\nAdapt to differe
 nt partners and music with ease on the social dance floor.\n\nWhat to Expe
 ct: Instructor Tyler blends a fun\, supportive atmosphere with structured
  lessons\, so you’re always challenged but never overwhelmed. Helping yo
 u progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDe
 tails:\n\nNo partner necessary—rotations ensure everyone dances.\n\nPlea
 se wear non-marking shoes to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10 minutes ear
 ly to warm up and get settled.\n\nWhen: Fridays\, 6:30 PM – 7:30 PM\n\n
 Instructor: Tyler Crandall\n\nWhere: 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Raf
 ael\, CA
LOCATION:4140 Redwood Highway #8 San Rafael
URL:https://www.pressdemocrat.com/events/#/details/intermediate-salsa-with
 -tyler/17624477/2026-08-28T18
X-SOURCE:Press Democrat
END:VEVENT
